    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Edge edits may not preserve valid biochemical kinetics.", "Evolutionary attribution is confounded by construction differences.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.8"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasEvidence> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/levin-2022-grn-learning-21--gpt--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/levin-2022-grn-learning-21--gpt--dataset-2>;
